{"id":"0a5cea7aef9d8542","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-invariance.md","title":"Invariance of Plain Complexity","display":"thm-invariance — Invariance of Plain Complexity","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-invariance","aliases":["43-thm-invariance"],"display":"thm-invariance — Invariance of Plain Complexity","depends_on":["[[43-df-kolm]]","[[43-df-optimal-plain-machine]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"§6.1, invariance discussion","source_printed_pages":"87","source_pdf_pages":"107","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-invariance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-invariance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-invariance — Invariance of Plain Complexity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"07d0eb32ffc2cbc0\" href=\"?note=07d0eb32ffc2cbc0\" title=\"43-df-optimal-plain-machine\">43-df-optimal-plain-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§6.1, invariance discussion"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"87"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"107"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\">\\(U,V\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalPlain}\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalPlain}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_U,C_V\">\\(C_U,C_V\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|C_U(\\sigma)-C_V(\\sigma)|\\le c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|C_U(\\sigma)-C_V(\\sigma)|\\le c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个模拟前缀的长度给出两方向加性上界，取其最大值。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§6.1, invariance discussion；印刷页 87，PDF 页 107。本次逐项核对陈述；下文给出笔记内论证，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-optimal-plain-machine","status":"resolved","id":"07d0eb32ffc2cbc0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-optimal-plain-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U,V$ 满足 $\\mathrm{UniversalPlain}$，$C_U,C_V$ 见 [[43-df-kolm]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U,V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalPlain}","display":false},{"tex":"C_U,C_V","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|C_U(\\sigma)-C_V(\\sigma)|\\le c.","display":true}],"bytes":1128,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-122","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-invariance]] — Invariance of Plain Complexity"}],"outgoing":["a0589ee7a1cc12e8","07d0eb32ffc2cbc0"]}